      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doing this as polling seems awkward; have you considered hooking it up to the type-C state machine instead? I think `tc_attached_src_entry` and `tc_attached_snk_entry` are the right points, where you can just set inversion depending on whether it\u0027s source or sink.\n\nThat would require hooking it up in a way that\u0027s not currently supported by the state machine (probably not difficult to do!), but seems much less wasteful than polling the charger.",
